# Small modules

- Keep packages and functions small, with a single clear responsibility.
- Prefer splitting into focused files over growing one large file.
- Follow [project-structure](project-structure.mdc): feature folders under `src/domain`, TUI in `src/ui`, shared helpers in `src/utils`.
- Extract a helper into its own file in the **same** feature folder first; move to `src/utils` only when reused.
